pointer-events:none;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff;transform:translateY(0pxpx)">★★★★★</span></div><div><p data-cy="rating-reviews-count">(<!-- -->4<!-- --> Reviews)</p></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><p><span>5</span>Amenity</p></div><div><p><span>4</span>Construction</p></div><div><p><span>4</span>Green Area</p></div><div><p><span>5</span>Connectivity</p></div></div></div></div><section><div><div><div><div data-cy="rating-sort-label">Sort By</div><div role="tablist" aria-label="Sort reviews"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="">Newest</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="">Highest Rating</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="">Lowest Rating</button></div></div></div></div><div><div><div class=""><div class=""><div>5<span style="margin-left:4px;margin-top:-3px"><div style="display:inline-block;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:1" aria-label="Rating: 1 out of 1" role="img"><span style="color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;top:5px;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff">★</span><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff;transform:translateY(5px)">★</span></div></span></div><div><h3></h3></div></div><div class=""><div></div><span><h4> Positive </h4>I would recommend buying a flat at Lodha Marquise if you’re looking for a posh complex in a good neighbourhood in Sobo. We absolutely liked the location of the project.<br/></span></div></div><div class=""><div class=""><div>5<span style="margin-left:4px;margin-top:-3px"><div style="display:inline-block;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:1" aria-label="Rating: 1 out of 1" role="img"><span style="color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;top:5px;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff">★</span><span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff;transform:translateY(5px)">★</span></div></span></div><div><h3></h3></div></div><div class=""><div></div><span><h4> Positive </h4>Overall, I like the project as it is based in a prime business location, the flats on offer are spacious, and it is offering many amenities.<br/></span></div></div><div><button type="button" data-cy="rating-view-all">View All<span class=""></span></button></div></div></div></section></div></section></div><div id="about-developer"><section id="about-builder" class=""><h3>About Builder - <!-- -->Lodha Group</h3><div><div><div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="builders/lodha-group"><div style="position:relative"><figure><picture><img title="Home" alt="Lodha Group" width="140" height="90" src="https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/developerlogo/1584179252.webp" style="object-fit:unset" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"/></picture></figure></div></a><div><div style="display:inline-block;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:1" aria-label="Rating: 5 out of 5" role="img"><span style="color:#ddd;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;top:0px;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff">★★★★★</span><span style="color:#EE6A2A;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #ffffff;transform:translateY(0pxpx)">★★★★★</span></div><span class="undefined undefined">Established In -<span>1980</span></span><span class="undefined undefined">Total Projects -<!-- --> <span>159</span></span></div></div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="builders/lodha-group">View Details</a></div><div class=""><div><div class="" style="max-width:100%;white-space:normal;padding-right:0;max-height:200px"><div><ul><li><strong>Lodha Group was founded in 1980</strong> by Mangal Prabhat Lodha. With a total experience of 46 years, Lodha is known for developing luxurious, life-integrated developments with a strong focus on sustainability. </li><li>Lodha has delivered <strong>246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes</strong>. Some of Lodha’s iconic developments include Lodha Palava, Altamount, Malabar, World Towers, and Lodha Park. </li><li>Today, Lodha has <strong>132 million square feet of land under construction across 40+ ongoing projects</strong>, making it one of the largest real estate developers in India. </li></ul><h4>Highlights of Lodha Group</h4><ul><li><strong>With 46+ years of experience</strong>, Lodha has become one of the top developers in India, known for delivering residential, commercial, and township developments across India and London. </li><li>Lodha’s projects are known for their <strong>premium construction quality,</strong> incorporating advanced engineering, high-quality material sourcing, and dual-team quality control.</li><li><strong>Integrated lifestyle developments</strong> are one of the biggest differentiators of Lodha, combining education, fitness, and retail all within one single township.</li><li>Its <strong>strong delivery track record </strong>includes the successful delivery of 246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes.</li><li>Lodha has established a <strong>strong pan-India and international presence</strong>, delivering projects in Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, and London.</li><li>The company has established a<strong> strong brand reputation</strong> through creating lavish residential developments that combine modern design, quality construction, and full-fledged lifestyles.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="faq"><div class="overviewBox undefined"><div><h2>FAQs about Lodha Marquise</h2><div style="max-height:auto;overflow-y:visible"><section class="styles_section__Es4Cp styles_sectionNoGap__i20Ou"><div class="introTitleoverview"></div><div class="overviewBox-faq1"><div class="styles_qaScrollWrapper__u8E2q" style="padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px"></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="overviewBox undefined"><section><h2>Questions &amp; Answers about<!-- --> Lodha Marquise</h2><div><div class="qa-ans"><section class="styles_section__Es4Cp styles_sectionNoGap__i20Ou overviewBox-faq1"><div class="introTitleoverview"></div><div class="overviewBox-faq1"><div class="styles_qaScrollWrapper__u8E2q" style="padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px"><div class="styles_item__3owJN"><details class="styles_accordion___DjVF accordion-property" open=""><summary class="styles_nativeSummary__YlPzy"><span class="styles_qLabel__eN0Sy">Q.</span><h3 class="styles_heading___v6C_">Are there good hospitals near Lodha Marquise?</h3></summary><div class="styles_nativePanel__wrm2L"><span>Yes,  Tata Memorial Hospital &amp; KEM Hospital are close to Lodha Marquise</span></div></details></div><div class="styles_item__3owJN"><details class="styles_accordion___DjVF accordion-property" open=""><summary class="styles_nativeSummary__YlPzy"><span class="styles_qLabel__eN0Sy">Q.</span><h3 class="styles_heading___v6C_">Is Lower Parel Station near the project?</h3></summary><div class="styles_nativePanel__wrm2L"><span>Yes,  Lower Parel station is within 5 to 10 minutes of Lodha Marquise</span></div></details></div><div class="styles_item__3owJN"><details class="styles_accordion___DjVF accordion-property" open=""><summary class="styles_nativeSummary__YlPzy"><span class="styles_qLabel__eN0Sy">Q.</span><h3 class="styles_heading___v6C_">Are there areas for senior citizens to relax at Lodha Marquise?</h3></summary><div class="styles_nativePanel__wrm2L"><span>Yes,  the property offers amenities such as reflexology park,  peaceful gardens,  and a serene Ganesh temple for senior citizens.</span></div></details></div><div class="styles_item__3owJN"><details class="styles_accordion___DjVF accordion-property" open=""><summary class="styles_nativeSummary__YlPzy"><span class="styles_qLabel__eN0Sy">Q.</span><h3 class="styles_heading___v6C_">Is the project pet friendly?</h3></summary><div class="styles_nativePanel__wrm2L"><span>Yes,  Lodha Marquise is pet friendly and features a pet garden and walk</span></div></details></div><div class="styles_item__3owJN"><details class="styles_accordion___DjVF accordion-property" open=""><summary class="styles_nativeSummary__YlPzy"><span class="styles_qLabel__eN0Sy">Q.</span><h3 class="styles_heading___v6C_">Does Lodha Marquise offer a gym?</h3></summary><div class="styles_nativePanel__wrm2L"><span>Yes,  the project features the famous Evander Holyfield gym along with an outdoor one.</span></div></details></div></div></div></section></div></div><div><div><div>Disclaimer: While Homebazaar.com takes all steps to ensure accuracy of the information provided in this section, please check the same with the developers. Homebazaar.com does not take responsibility for any discrepancies in the information provided.</div></div><div class="buttoncontainer-qa"><div class="customOne"></div></div></div></section></div><div id="pricechart" class="mobPropertyDetails_pdpPageMicroPriceSection__uFQ_L"><section class="mobPropertyDetails_root__a3_rF mobPropertyDetails_pricechart__XKpjd"><div class="pricechartBox"><h3 class="mobPropertyDetails_priceChartTitle__R_nc7">Price Insights of <!-- -->Worli</h3><div class="mobPropertyDetails_priceChartWrap__SNXMV"><div aria-hidden="true" style="min-height:320px"></div></div><div class="property-insights" style="margin-top:20px;text-align:left"><h3>Here are some key pointers based on the graph:</h3><div class="mobPropertyDetails_insightItem__mIxs7"><strong>1.Location : </strong> <!-- -->The graph represents property price insights for Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli.</div><div class="mobPropertyDetails_insightItem__mIxs7"><strong>2.Timeframe : </strong> <!-- -->The data covers the years 2016 and 2026.</div><div class="mobPropertyDetails_insightItem__mIxs7"><strong>3.Price per sqft : </strong><div style="margin-left:50px"><div>2016: ₹32,300 Sq.ft</div><div>2017: ₹40,000 Sq.ft (increase by 23.8%)</div><div>2018: ₹41,350 Sq.ft (increase by 3.4%)</div><div>2019: ₹38,500 Sq.ft (Decreased by 6.9%)</div><div>2020: ₹36,400 Sq.ft (Decreased by 5.5%)</div><div>2021: ₹40,400 Sq.ft (increase by 11%)</div><div>2022: ₹41,050 Sq.ft (increase by 1.6%)</div><div>2023: ₹58,400 Sq.ft (increase by 42.3%)</div><div>2024: ₹62,500 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)</div><div>2025: ₹63,100 Sq.ft (increase by 1%)</div><div>2026: ₹67,517 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)</div></div></div><div class="mobPropertyDetails_insightItem__mIxs7"><strong>4.Trend : </strong> <!-- -->The property prices in Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli increased by 109% over the period 2016 to 2026</div></div></div></section></div><div id="about"><section id="about" class="undefined overviewBox"><h4 class="mobPropertyDetails_introductionAreaTitle__5fWqd introTitleoverview1"> About Worli, Mumbai</h4><div class="expandableText_readMoreWrapper__t33Sg" style="flex-direction:column"><span class="expandableText_multiLineClamp__FVWbj" style="max-width:100%;white-space:normal;padding-right:0;max-height:200px"><span><p>Worli is a residential/commercial hub with luxury real estate, attracting the rich and famous, and blending heritage. Worli’s location is strategic, and it gives seamless connectivity to key corridors and urban infrastructure. It is the ideal location for residents who prioritize luxury and convenience. </p><p>The new Metro Aqua line connects Worli directly to key areas like BKC, Dadar, Chhatrapati International Airport and both South and North Mumbai. People travelling by train can easily get to Lower Parel and Prabhadevi railway stations on the Western Line. Worli also has a network of buses and taxis. </p><p>Residents enjoy proximity to retail shops, dining, and shopping centres. It’s close to some cultural and leisure attractions such as Worli Sea Face, Worli Fort, Nehru Planetarium and the iconic Bandra-Worli Sea Link, while reputable hospitals like M.A. Podar Hospital, KEM Hospital, TATA Memorial Hospital, etc. are all within a few minutes of drive. </p><p>Worli is the best combination of connectivity, lifestyle amenities, scenic views, and urban infrastructure, which makes it desirable.</p></span></span><span class=""><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;width:100%"><span style="color:#0056B2;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Read More About the Locality</span><span class="expandableText_arrow__Ed_IA"></span></span></span></div></section></div><div id="projectList" class="mobPropertyDetails_pdpStack__ti3Ka"><section><div><div><div class="introTitleoverview "><h4 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:19px;margin-bottom:10px;font-family:Open Sans, sans-serif!important">Similar Projects Nearby in  Worli, Mumbai</h4></div><div><div><a href="birla-niyaara-worli-5037" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><div><img fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" src="https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a3d26937d5c1_birla-niyaara-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72" alt="Birla Niyaara"/></div><div><h5>Birla Niyaara</h5><p>Starting From 4.75 Cr</p></div></div></a><a href="lodha-the-park-worli-269" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><div><img fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" src="https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a4b4b7d15fe5_lodha-the-park-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72" alt="Lodha The Park"/></div><div><h5>Lodha The Park</h5><p>Starting From 6.5 Cr</p></div></div></a><a href="lodha-world-crest-lower-parel-2249" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><div><img fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" src="https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a58b5023edef_lodha-world-crest-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72" alt="Lodha World Crest"/></div><div><h5>Lodha World Crest</h5><p>Starting From 10.14 Cr