20: ₹36,400 Sq.ft (Decreased by 5.5%)"},{"year":"2021","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"40400","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2021: ₹40,400 Sq.ft (increase by 11%)"},{"year":"2022","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"41050","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2022: ₹41,050 Sq.ft (increase by 1.6%)"},{"year":"2023","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"58400","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2023: ₹58,400 Sq.ft (increase by 42.3%)"},{"year":"2024","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"62500","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2024: ₹62,500 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)"},{"year":"2025","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"63100","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2025: ₹63,100 Sq.ft (increase by 1%)"},{"year":"2026","l_id":69,"sl_id":846,"jan":"67517","apr":"","jul":"","oct":"","price_trends":"2026: ₹67,517 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)"}],"insights":{"location":"The graph represents property price insights for Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli.","timeframe":"The data covers the years 2016 and 2026.","price_per_sqft":["2016: ₹32,300 Sq.ft","2017: ₹40,000 Sq.ft (increase by 23.8%)","2018: ₹41,350 Sq.ft (increase by 3.4%)","2019: ₹38,500 Sq.ft (Decreased by 6.9%)","2020: ₹36,400 Sq.ft (Decreased by 5.5%)","2021: ₹40,400 Sq.ft (increase by 11%)","2022: ₹41,050 Sq.ft (increase by 1.6%)","2023: ₹58,400 Sq.ft (increase by 42.3%)","2024: ₹62,500 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)","2025: ₹63,100 Sq.ft (increase by 1%)","2026: ₹67,517 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)"],"trend":"The property prices in Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli increased by 109% over the period 2016 to 2026","market_insight":""},"brochure":{"pId":2238,"projectName":"Lodha Marquise","brochure":"https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/admin/public/images/brochure/1704436323_brochure.pdf","updatedOn":"2024-01-05 12:02:03"},"progress":{"launchDate":"","possessionDate":"12-2024"},"bank":[],"nearby":{"latitude":"19.0061996","longitude":"72.826655"},"distance":{"source":"Lodha Marquise, Opp. Hard Rock Cafe, Next To Shri Simandhar Swami jain Mandir, Pandurang Budhkar Rd, Worli, Mumbai, 400013"},"locality":{"locality":"Worli","city":"Mumbai","addressRegion":"Maharashtra","postalCode":"400013","addressCountry":"IN","description":"\u003cp\u003eWorli is a residential/commercial hub with luxury real estate, attracting the rich and famous, and blending heritage. Worli’s location is strategic, and it gives seamless connectivity to key corridors and urban infrastructure. It is the ideal location for residents who prioritize luxury and convenience. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new Metro Aqua line connects Worli directly to key areas like BKC, Dadar, Chhatrapati International Airport and both South and North Mumbai. People travelling by train can easily get to Lower Parel and Prabhadevi railway stations on the Western Line. Worli also has a network of buses and taxis. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eResidents enjoy proximity to retail shops, dining, and shopping centres. It’s close to some cultural and leisure attractions such as Worli Sea Face, Worli Fort, Nehru Planetarium and the iconic Bandra-Worli Sea Link, while reputable hospitals like M.A. Podar Hospital, KEM Hospital, TATA Memorial Hospital, etc. are all within a few minutes of drive. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorli is the best combination of connectivity, lifestyle amenities, scenic views, and urban infrastructure, which makes it desirable.\u003c/p\u003e","description_plainText":"Worli is a residential/commercial hub with luxury real estate, attracting the rich and famous, and blending heritage. Worli’s location is strategic, and it gives seamless connectivity to key corridors and urban infrastructure. It is the ideal location for residents who prioritize luxury and convenience. The new Metro Aqua line connects Worli directly to key areas like BKC, Dadar, Chhatrapati International Airport and both South and North Mumbai. People travelling by train can easily get to Lower Parel and Prabhadevi railway stations on the Western Line. Worli also has a network of buses and taxis. Residents enjoy proximity to retail shops, dining, and shopping centres. It’s close to some cultural and leisure attractions such as Worli Sea Face, Worli Fort, Nehru Planetarium and the iconic Bandra-Worli Sea Link, while reputable hospitals like M.A. Podar Hospital, KEM Hospital, TATA Memorial Hospital, etc. are all within a few minutes of drive. Worli is the best combination of connectivity, lifestyle amenities, scenic views, and urban infrastructure, which makes it desirable."},"builder":{"id":12,"developerName":"Lodha Group","developerDesc":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLodha Group was founded in 1980\u003c/strong\u003e by Mangal Prabhat Lodha. With a total experience of 46 years, Lodha is known for developing luxurious, life-integrated developments with a strong focus on sustainability. \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLodha has delivered \u003cstrong\u003e246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes\u003c/strong\u003e. Some of Lodha’s iconic developments include Lodha Palava, Altamount, Malabar, World Towers, and Lodha Park. \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eToday, Lodha has \u003cstrong\u003e132 million square feet of land under construction across 40+ ongoing projects\u003c/strong\u003e, making it one of the largest real estate developers in India. \u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eHighlights of Lodha Group\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWith 46+ years of experience\u003c/strong\u003e, Lodha has become one of the top developers in India, known for delivering residential, commercial, and township developments across India and London. \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLodha’s projects are known for their \u003cstrong\u003epremium construction quality,\u003c/strong\u003e incorporating advanced engineering, high-quality material sourcing, and dual-team quality control.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated lifestyle developments\u003c/strong\u003e are one of the biggest differentiators of Lodha, combining education, fitness, and retail all within one single township.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003estrong delivery track record \u003c/strong\u003eincludes the successful delivery of 246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLodha has established a \u003cstrong\u003estrong pan-India and international presence\u003c/strong\u003e, delivering projects in Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, and London.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe company has established a\u003cstrong\u003e strong brand reputation\u003c/strong\u003e through creating lavish residential developments that combine modern design, quality construction, and full-fledged lifestyles.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","developerHighlights":"","establishDate":1980,"developerLogo":"https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/developerlogo/1584179252.webp","developerImageName":"lodha-group","developerAlt":"Lodha Group","developerCredibility":"5","developer_slug":"https://www.homebazaar.com/builders/lodha-group","projectCount":159,"developerDesc_plainText":"Lodha Group was founded in 1980 by Mangal Prabhat Lodha. With a total experience of 46 years, Lodha is known for developing luxurious, life-integrated developments with a strong focus on sustainability. Lodha has delivered 246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes . Some of Lodha’s iconic developments include Lodha Palava, Altamount, Malabar, World Towers, and Lodha Park. Today, Lodha has 132 million square feet of land under construction across 40+ ongoing projects , making it one of the largest real estate developers in India. Highlights of Lodha Group With 46+ years of experience , Lodha has become one of the top developers in India, known for delivering residential, commercial, and township developments across India and London. Lodha’s projects are known for their premium construction quality, incorporating advanced engineering, high-quality material sourcing, and dual-team quality control. Integrated lifestyle developments are one of the biggest differentiators of Lodha, combining education, fitness, and retail all within one single township. Its strong delivery track record includes the successful delivery of 246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes. Lodha has established a strong pan-India and international presence , delivering projects in Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, and London. The company has established a strong brand reputation through creating lavish residential developments that combine modern design, quality construction, and full-fledged lifestyles."},"faq_title":"FAQs about Lodha Marquise","faq":[],"rating":{"summary":[{"review_count":4,"amenity_avg":"5","area_avg":"4","connectivity_avg":"5","management_avg":"0","construction_avg":"4","advantage_tag":"","disadvantage_tag":"","star1_percentage":"0%","star2_percentage":"0%","star3_percentage":"0%","star4_percentage":"50%","star5_percentage":"50%","total_avg":4.5}],"list":[{"prop_advantage":"I mainly invested in a 2 BHK at Lodha Marquise as it is located in a good area and is close to commercial spaces and retail malls.","prop_disadvantage":null,"total_avg":"4","review_member":"Owner","advantage_tag":"","disadvantage_tag":"","reviwer_name":"Peter Lobo","formated_created_date":"3 years ago"},{"prop_advantage":"We got a flat here as the project is nearing possession. There are also excellent schools and hospitals nearby, which is perfect for families with kids and aged parents.","prop_disadvantage":null,"total_avg":"4","review_member":"Owner","advantage_tag":"","disadvantage_tag":"","reviwer_name":"Jyoti Acharya","formated_created_date":"3 years ago"},{"prop_advantage":"Overall, I like the project as it is based in a prime business location, the flats on offer are spacious, and it is offering many amenities.","prop_disadvantage":null,"total_avg":"5","review_member":"Owner","advantage_tag":"","disadvantage_tag":"","reviwer_name":"Megha Kinney","formated_created_date":"3 years ago"},{"prop_advantage":"I would recommend buying a flat at Lodha Marquise if you’re looking for a posh complex in a good neighbourhood in Sobo. We absolutely liked the location of the project.","prop_disadvantage":null,"total_avg":"5","review_member":"Owner","advantage_tag":"","disadvantage_tag":"","reviwer_name":"Mahima Joshi","formated_created_date":"3 years ago"}],"reviewMember":[{"id":6,"name":"Owner"},{"id":7,"name":"Tenant"},{"id":8,"name":"Former Resident"},{"id":9,"name":"Real Estate Agent"},{"id":10,"name":"Lives Nearby"},{"id":11,"name":"First-Time Buyer"},{"id":12,"name":"Second Home Buyer"},{"id":13,"name":"Residential Investor"},{"id":14,"name":"NRI Buyer"},{"id":15,"name":"Luxury Buyer"},{"id":16,"name":"Family Buyer"},{"id":17,"name":"Business Owner"},{"id":18,"name":"Commercial Investor"}],"ratingFeature":[{"id":6,"heading":"Amenities \u0026 Other Features","subHeading":"Are you satisfied with the amenities in the project?","datePublished":"2021-05-28 13:54:29"},{"id":7,"heading":"Open areas \u0026 Gardens","subHeading":"Is it suitable for you and your family?","datePublished":"2021-05-28 13:54:29"},{"id":8,"heading":"Connectivity \u0026 Daily Commuting","subHeading":"Is the connectivity hassle-fee?","datePublished":"2021-05-28 13:55:17"},{"id":9,"heading":"RWA \u0026 Society Management","subHeading":"How fulfilled you are with the maintenance \u0026 additional services?","datePublished":"2021-05-28 13:55:17"},{"id":10,"heading":"The Quality Of Construction","subHeading":"Describe the condition of the building and its surrounding","datePublished":"2021-05-28 13:55:41"}]},"lastReviewed":"2021-05-28","qa":{"category":["New Projects","Sale","Purchase","Rentals","Residential","Commercial","Home Loan","Legal and Taxation","Investment","Information - City/Locality","Others"],"city":[{"id":1,"name":"Mumbai"},{"id":2,"name":"Pu